<title>POLAND: Remak sees no 1996 dividend payout.</title>
<headline>Remak sees no 1996 dividend payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish engineering company Remak SA wants to allot all of its 98,508 zloty next profit for last year to boost reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The final decision will be taken at the general shareholders meeting on June 7, it said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
